# Sample requests for an HTTP client. Replace variables locally; do not commit real tokens.
# Run Seed-DemoCatalogue.ps1 once with an administrator token before using DSTA/DSTC/DM001.
@base = http://localhost:8080
@accessToken = replace-with-passenger-access-token
@adminToken = replace-with-admin-access-token
@pnr = replace-with-booking-pnr
# Replace with a future boarding date no later than today plus two calendar months (India time).
@date = replace-with-YYYY-MM-DD

### Search (CNF/WL suggestion is advisory)
GET {{base}}/api/reservations/search?fromStation=DSTA&toStation=DSTC&dateOfJourney={{date}}&seatClass=SL&passengers=2

### Quote DM001, two seats, INR 240 for the seeded demo route
GET {{base}}/api/reservations/quote?trainNumber=DM001&fromStation=DSTA&toStation=DSTC&dateOfJourney={{date}}&seatClass=SL&passengers=2

### Create one whole booking. Change the idempotency key for a NEW booking, keep it for retries.
POST {{base}}/api/reservations/book
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-booking-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{"trainNumber":"DM001","fromStation":"DSTA","toStation":"DSTC","dateOfJourney":"{{date}}","seatClass":"SL","expectedTotalFare":240.00,"passengers":[{"name":"Demo One","age":25,"gender":"OTHER","birthPreference":"LOWER"},{"name":"Demo Two","age":30,"gender":"OTHER","birthPreference":"NONE"}]}

### Create Razorpay TEST order from the saved booking amount
POST {{base}}/api/payments/create-order
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"pnr":"{{pnr}}"}

# Complete provider TEST checkout with its configured test account.
# /api/payments/verify requires the actual signed test checkout result; do not fabricate it.

### Booking and payment/refund status
GET {{base}}/api/reservations/pnr/{{pnr}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Payment status (SUCCESS can accompany a WL ticket)
GET {{base}}/api/payments/{{pnr}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Filtered history
GET {{base}}/api/reservations/my-bookings?page=0&size=10&sort=bookingTime&direction=desc&status=WL&fromDate={{date}}&toDate={{date}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Cancellation preview
GET {{base}}/api/reservations/{{pnr}}/cancellation-preview
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Cancel whole booking; triggers promotion of eligible paid WL bookings
DELETE {{base}}/api/reservations/{{pnr}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Download current demo PDF after verified test payment
GET {{base}}/api/reservations/{{pnr}}/ticket.pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Save passenger
POST {{base}}/api/users/me/passengers
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Saved Demo Traveller","age":25,"gender":"OTHER","berthPreference":"LOWER"}

### Master List
GET {{base}}/api/users/me/passengers?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Paginated catalogue
GET {{base}}/api/trains?page=0&size=10&sort=trainNumber&direction=asc

### Invite another admin; email goes only to the specified invitee
POST {{base}}/api/auth/admin/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"replace-with-invitee-address@example.test"}

### Current-device logout
POST {{base}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### All-device logout (use a still-active session)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/logout-all
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
